<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">钥匙自助借还指南</view>
    <view class="muted">
      智能钥匙柜遵循“提前预约、按时取钥、扫码归还”的标准闭环流程。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">标准使用流程</view>
    <view class="flow-step">
      <view class="flow-num">1</view>
      <view class="flow-info">
        <view class="flow-title">线上预约</view>
        <view class="muted small">在【找钥匙】列表中选择所需房间钥匙并提交预约时间。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="flow-step">
      <view class="flow-num">2</view>
      <view class="flow-info">
        <view class="flow-title">现场取钥</view>
        <view class="muted small">到达钥匙柜后，在首页或记录中点击【发起取钥】，设备自动旋转出柜并开门。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="flow-step">
      <view class="flow-num">3</view>
      <view class="flow-info">
        <view class="flow-title">RFID 归还</view>
        <view class="muted small">使用完毕后点击【发起归还】，将钥匙放入归还口完成芯片识别入库。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="btn-primary center" bindtap="goKeys">前往找钥匙并预约</view>
  <view class="btn-secondary center mt-12" bindtap="goRecords">查看我的借还记录</view>
</view>
